{"id":1083,"name":"Harmonie","slug":"harmonie","synopsis":"Every person has his or her own little world. Among the 34 bustling students of classroom 2-1, there are many such worlds.\n\nHonjou Akio's world — my world — is filled with passionate talk about last night's anime with Yoshida, Watanabe, and other friends. It's an fun, comfortable place…. But, I always wonder. Wonder about the world of Makina Juri, smiling and surrounded by gorgeous friends on the other side of the classroom.\n\nOne day, I enter her world. But it's not as simple as it sounds.\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)\n\n\nHarmonie was one of the four films of Anime Mirai 2014 (Young Animator Training Project), a project funded by the Japanese government's Agency of Cultural Affairs in order to support training animators.","format":"MOVIE","season":"WINTER","year":2014,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:43:52","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 02:54:33","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":20903},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":20501},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":8105},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":10202},{"site":"ANN","externalId":15688},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":7029}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":2157,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/f3TJxJFTz2sRCeOT1MhSYVVQm740phHZmEewzGVR.jpg"},{"id":2158,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/GWnfdfBAdzZd8Ii2tQFTyCzoCpg5erfy33wtFxqk.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":176,"name":"Studio Rikka","slug":"studio_rikka"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":5895,"slug":"ED1","type":"ED","sequence":null,"song":{"id":5895,"title":"Harmonie","titleNative":null},"animethemeentries":[{"id":6792,"version":1,"episodes":null,"nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":5696,"basename":"Harmonie-ED1-NCBD1080.webm","filename":"Harmonie-ED1-NCBD1080","link":"https://v.animethemes.moe/Harmonie-ED1-NCBD1080.webm","mimetype":"video/webm","size":28884805,"resolution":1080,"nc":true,"subbed":false,"lyrics":false,"overlap":"NONE","source":"BD"